# The conversion of an argument that can never pass the entry test of the callee always throws: it has the type never, it ends its block, and neither the conversions behind it nor the call are made
# FORM: Prepared
# RUN: pass ResolveCalls
# CHECK: outcome: Changed

module m0 path="main.js" displayPath="main.js"
typesite w0 module=m0 position=9 kind=Parameter text="number"
